  "body": "This release adds a new feature to provide visibility into specific HTTP error status codes:\r\n\r\n  -E, --extended            EXTENDED, print breakdown of all HTTP status codes\r\n  -e, --extended-errors     EXTENDED ERRORS, print breakdown of each error code\r\n\r\nTrack all 4xx and 5xx HTTP response status codes per worker using a lightweight, lock-free error map.\r\nAggregate and display a sorted breakdown of each error code in both standard summary and JSON output modes.\r\n\r\nIt also contains several minor bug fixes and refinements. All users should update to version 4.2.2"
